            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zuò gāotiě kěyǐ zhídá Běijīng — The high-speed train takes you straight to Beijing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
