              "text": "进入 — jìnrù — \"to go into\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "wǎng qián zǒu jiù kěyǐ jìnrù chēzhàn — Go straight on and you can get into the station."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 入 (rù) — two strokes: a short stroke falling to the left, then a long stroke falling to the right that starts higher, above the top of the first. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
